text: >-
  March 18, 2026

  Page 2 of 4

  threats of violence being directed toward certain individuals at TPUSA. I
  address

  some of the most egregious defamatory statements that you have made below.

  Response to Specific False Statements

  False Statements Alleging That Erika Kirk Was Involved in the Murder of

  Charlie Kirk

  In numerous posts on X, you have falsely alleged that Mrs. Kirk was involved
  or

  participated in the murder of Charlie Kirk. Here are just a few examples:

  • In a December 21, 2025 post, you wrote that "Erika Kirk is So COOKED...

  because we are so close to nailing her ass to the wall with being involved in

  this conspiracy to take out Charlie."

  • In a February 11, 2026 reply to Laura Loomer asking how anyone could defend

  Candace Owens's suggestion that Mrs. Kirk be dragged into a police precinct

  because of her alleged involvement in Charlie Kirk's murder, you wrote:

  "[B]ecause there is overwhelming evidence that she [Mrs. Kirk] did play a role

  in his murder. wake up."

  • In a February 18, 2026 reply to someone praising your work, you wrote,

  "absolutely. she [Mrs. Kirk] may not ever face prison for killing Charlie but
  i

  will keep exposing her in the court of public opinion until the day i die."

  • In a February 23, 2026 reply to Laura Loomer and Mrs. Kirk, you stated that

  Mrs. Kirk "participated in her husband's murder and cover-up."

  • On March 5, 2026, in response to a post you made of a Baron Coleman podcast,

  you stated, "i believe she [Erika Kirk] participated in Charlie's murder."

  Mrs. Kirk had nothing to do with her husband's murder. Any statement to the

  contrary is absolutely false and made with actual malice—i.e., with knowledge
  of the

  statement's falsity or with reckless disregard for the truth. Moreover,
  because the

  actions you impute to Mrs. Kirk are punishable by imprisonment or regarded as

  involving moral turpitude, damages are presumed. In short, your statements are
  per

  se defamatory.

  False Statements Alleging That Erika Kirk Was Involved in Sex-Trafficking

  You have also repeatedly alleged that Mrs. Kirk was involved in
  sex-trafficking and

  an operative for Jeffrey Epstein. Again, just a few examples will suffice to
  show the

  nature of the defamatory statements you have made:
